{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RuDbi0xgy01795785149.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>再有駐日本美軍涉嫌犯案被捕。</p><p></p><p>日本傳媒報道，沖繩縣警方周五以涉嫌非法侵入住宅為理由，拘捕一名駐日美軍人員，據報他當日凌晨試圖闖入沖繩市一處住宅，被捕後否認指控，他在警方呼氣測試中驗出酒精成分。</p><p></p><p>上月初，沖繩縣那霸市有一名美軍士兵，涉嫌劫殺一名日本女子被捕，引起日本政府和民眾抗議。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:04:02.676909+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:37:38.238508+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:25.113939+00:00","content_hash":"42260bb3a620324078d60caaf6e654786d13d62adbba62123fe21773c1b6c696","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}